@startuml
title SYS-SEQ01  UC01 学生账号注册、使用与资料维护
skinparam backgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #111111
    LifeLineBorderColor #777777
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #7A8796
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E7EEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #222222
    ActorBorderColor #7A8796
    ActorBackgroundColor #E7EEF8
    ActorFontColor #222222
    GroupBorderColor #F0A060
    GroupHeaderFontColor #333333
    GroupFontColor #333333
    ActivationBorderColor #5E6A78
    ActivationBackgroundColor #DCE8F8
    DividerBackgroundColor white
    DividerBorderColor #999999
}

actor 学生用户 as Student
participant 校园二手交易平台 as System
participant 邮件验证码服务 as Mail
participant Session服务 as Session

group 注册与邮箱验证
    Student -> System : 提交注册邮箱
    activate System
    System -> System : 校验邮箱是否可注册
    System -> Mail : 发送注册验证码
    activate Mail
    Mail --> Student : 投递注册验证码
    deactivate Mail
    Student -> System : 提交验证码、密码和必要资料
    System -> System : 校验验证码用途、有效期和次数
    alt 验证通过且资料符合规则
        System -> System : 创建学生账号并设为可用状态
        System -> Session : 建立登录Session
        activate Session
        Session --> System : Session已建立
        deactivate Session
        System --> Student : 返回注册成功和当前用户信息
    else 验证失败或资料不符合规则
        System --> Student : 返回注册失败原因
    end
    deactivate System
end

group 登录、会话恢复与退出
    Student -> System : 提交邮箱和密码
    activate System
    System -> System : 校验账号状态和密码
    alt 校验成功
        System -> Session : 创建/刷新HttpOnly Session
        activate Session
        Session --> System : Session有效
        deactivate Session
        System --> Student : 返回登录成功
    else 校验失败
        System --> Student : 返回登录失败原因
    end

    Student -> System : 请求恢复当前身份 /user/me
    System -> Session : 校验当前Session
    activate Session
    Session --> System : 返回Session身份/无有效Session
    deactivate Session
    System --> Student : 返回当前用户信息/未登录状态

    Student -> System : 请求退出
    System -> Session : 销毁当前Session
    activate Session
    Session --> System : Session已失效
    deactivate Session
    System --> Student : 返回退出成功
    deactivate System
end

group 密码找回
    Student -> System : 请求找回密码
    activate System
    System -> Mail : 发送找回密码验证码
    activate Mail
    Mail --> Student : 投递找回验证码
    deactivate Mail
    Student -> System : 提交验证码和新密码
    System -> System : 校验验证码并更新密码
    System -> Session : 使相关旧Session失效
    activate Session
    Session --> System : 旧Session已失效
    deactivate Session
    System --> Student : 返回密码重置结果
    deactivate System
end

group 个人资料维护
    Student -> System : 提交昵称、校区区域等资料
    activate System
    System -> Session : 识别当前学生用户
    activate Session
    Session --> System : 返回当前用户身份
    deactivate Session
    System -> System : 校验并更新本人资料
    System --> Student : 返回更新后的个人资料
    deactivate System
end
@enduml
